1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,400
Rosie. It's me. I have to tell you
something I should have said a long
time ago.

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:09,433
My voice. Every pause exactly where
I'd put it. Except it never takes a
breath.

3
00:00:09,933 --> 00:00:14,533
Rule eleven. Everything alive breathes
between sentences. Listen for the gap.

4
00:00:15,033 --> 00:00:18,600
I stopped looking for you. For years.
I told myself you were gone.
